=== a fragment rustfmt would change beyond whitespace keeps its source
context: expr
prefix: width={
suffix: }
--- input
            width={((column))}
--- error
rustfmt changed
=== a fragment rustfmt rejects (here, an incomplete one) keeps its source
context: expr
prefix: value={
suffix: }
--- input
            value={count +}
--- error
rustfmt rejected
=== a neighbour of a rejected fragment in the same run is still formatted
context: expr
prefix: value={
suffix: }
--- input
            value={ a+b }
--- expected
            value={a + b}
